{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p02", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 2, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p02.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [102, 96, 952, 72], "text": "下雨了， 小满、花花只好在家里玩。 三块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [116, 186, 501, 29], "text": "“我们一起搭城堡，搭高高，还不倒。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1269, 324, 68, 25], "text": "四块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [870, 584, 95, 27], "text": "五块，", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [870, 628, 216, 29], "text": "积木城堡没有倒。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b06", "bbox": [271, 749, 1143, 31], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 五 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 数一数，每幅小图中的城堡是用几块积木搭成的？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05", "b06"], "sha256": "59993a871a161e5f14dd6bd67c162068b33230b066e67a79da3e1969db0336d3"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p03", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 3, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p03.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [77, 72, 68, 25], "text": "六块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1227, 119, 113, 24], "text": "九块……", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [561, 176, 69, 25], "text": "七块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [98, 443, 69, 25], "text": "八块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [940, 579, 114, 27], "text": "积木城堡", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b06", "bbox": [271, 749, 1103, 31], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 六 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 观察画面，说一说小满的表情变化。", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05", "b06"], "sha256": "a4b30ceb3668d2e942f2bcd2c352d77c50d57ce58b1116a6f39a5028c57a0fda"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p04", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 4, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p04.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [158, 81, 451, 28], "text": "花花放上小木门，高高积木动了动。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [955, 610, 469, 28], "text": "小满放上小木窗，高高积木晃三晃。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [969, 657, 324, 27], "text": "“小心，小心，要小心。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [294, 747, 1120, 33], "text": "汉字源流 楷书 放 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 观察画面中小满的动作，猜一猜马上要发生什么？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "f2abdd3ad050a2b3467fa10b30e9386806d78ec1b998976be0b16396d7bd0249"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p05", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 5, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p05.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [886, 64, 539, 28], "text": "不好！不好！积木城堡一倒，积木满地跑。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [885, 112, 628, 25], "text": "一块、两块、三块、四块、五块、六块、七块、八块、", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [886, 158, 113, 24], "text": "九块……", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 748, 1084, 32], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 金文 小篆 隶书 七 楷书 阅读指导 说一说，积木城堡为什么倒了？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "aa788008659bcbaeb718e323bd008b282dfa29ec3c50484d414c3afd5a336428"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p06", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 6, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p06.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [1159, 43, 265, 27], "text": "“我不要和小满玩！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1159, 90, 265, 28], "text": "“我也不和花花玩！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [110, 338, 410, 28], "text": "高高积木倒一地，花花很生气。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [124, 385, 236, 28], "text": "“小满，都怪你！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 746, 1098, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 木 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 猜一猜，小满和花花还会一起玩吗？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "7f2803ffaa319eb204bc96b4a10222ef9436bbd3b8da18b408c5576675e96f0c"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p07", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 7, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p07.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [104, 105, 234, 28], "text": "花花在家玩积木。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [119, 152, 501, 28], "text": "“一个人，不好玩，真想出去找小满。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [930, 569, 234, 29], "text": "小满来到草地上。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [944, 616, 501, 28], "text": "“小虫子，真好看，想和花花一起玩。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 750, 1106, 30], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 八 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 说一说，为什么小满和花花都不开心？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "f0a6cadb388885edd8d3cd256b06b09110488bad29a6101fdd3f43f6d96eb9a2"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p08", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 8, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p08.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [256, 91, 232, 28], "text": "花花的生日到了，", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [256, 138, 352, 27], "text": "可是花花一点儿也不开心。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [270, 185, 324, 27], "text": "“想和小满一起过生日。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 749, 1113, 31], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 金文 小篆 隶书 日 楷书 阅读指导 想一想，花花现在的表情会是什么样的？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "d320e1a32c08e26d37dfafde9444b92840a41e478c845def9f551b1d0d99da64"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p09", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 9, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p09.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [903, 129, 293, 28], "text": "小满画好了生日卡片。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [918, 176, 383, 28], "text": "“花花会不会喜欢我的卡片？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1195, 392, 295, 29], "text": "“黄米团，你去哪儿？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 747, 1069, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 片 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 猜一猜，黄米团要去哪里？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "e811c70b3e295fc2866bc0e170c4108cfc829c9662ad9d85ef90fa4c8efd0308"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p10", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 10, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p10.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [292, 161, 113, 29], "text": "“黄米团，", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [277, 208, 176, 28], "text": "你怎么来了？", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [277, 256, 237, 27], "text": "你咬的是什么？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [1065, 541, 263, 27], "text": "小满、花花见了面。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [1080, 587, 265, 28], "text": "“花花，生日快乐！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b06", "bbox": [1080, 634, 265, 28], "text": "“生日卡片真好看！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b07", "bbox": [339, 746, 1053, 34], "text": "汉字源流 隶书 卡 楷书 阅读指导 说一说，小满和花花现在的心情是怎样的？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05", "b06", "b07"], "sha256": "77e0f4d7e138da42dcd90d91d8214bb04eac73be27ecbefe2d4a087556802d75"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh01_p11", "book_id": "zh01", "page_no": 11, "image_path": "data/books/zh01/pages/p11.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [133, 93, 236, 28], "text": "“花花，对不起！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [133, 139, 471, 29], "text": "“小满，我们一起过生日，好不好？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1124, 505, 265, 29], "text": "“我早就不生气了。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [1110, 552, 175, 27], "text": "花花好开心。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 751, 1179, 29], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 心 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 说一说，小满和花花最开始为什么吵架？现在她们和好了吗？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "36cc7d87581d1c726d3180809cd1d2f36b29a204f10c4f2eea9926526c7729a6"}
